# Air Modal dividers

`DS.modal({ dividers })` mirrors Figma `showHeaderDivider` / `showFooterDivider`. Default is **off**.

## Rule

| Modal type | `dividers` |
|---|---|
| Short confirm / alert (message + CTAs) | omit / `false` |
| Simple form (few fields, short body) | omit / `false` |
| Scrollable or dense body (tables, assign lists, timelines, long multi-section forms) | `true` (both) |

## Do not

- Use partial `{ header: true }` or `{ footer: true }` unless a Figma frame explicitly specs one side only.

## Reference

- API: `DS.modal`, `DS.MODAL_LAYOUT` in `components.js`
